review_text:
[Updated, see below]

I truly believe behind the bugs and glitches there is a good game here, but right now it just is not worth it. I will list the bugs that have been happening frequently hoping that they get fixed, then I will recommend this product:

After loading a save, all doors that were unlocked become locked again;
Frequently, for some reason, some kind of "shadow" obscures your view for some seconds before going away. From what I've heard, it starts when you pick up the radar;
The [spoiler] baby [/spoiler] usually gets stuck in the vents;
The audio has many problems, like The Butcher shouting but literally nothing has happend (like when he is walking or standing still normally) and the audio settings are very sensitive (70% the jumpscare is too low, 80% is somewhat high), but maybe this one is my headset's fault;
Some dropped items can have a complete gravity shift and be stuck on the ceilling;
The red area which cameras can see frequently bugs out and appears on places that don't even have a camera.

Update!!!

Almost all game breaking bugs have been corrected, so now I would say this is a very good purchase if you liked previous work from Puppet Combo (especially Nun Massacre) and it's a pretty nice game for this Halloween!
